{"id": "DfXKs4Ev3al", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "Heaven’s army attacked. Even Karna ran.\nस्वर्ग की सेना टूट पड़ी... और कर्ण भी भाग निकले।\n\nIn the years of exile, Yudhishthira could not sleep for fear of Karna. Then Duryodhana and Karna rode into the forest with an army to flaunt their glory before the Pandavas, and at the lake the Gandharvas, warriors of heaven, barred their way. The army ran. Karna alone stood, until his chariot was cut to pieces. Duryodhana would not run, and was seized. And the men he came to mock came to save him: Arjuna, with the divine weapons he brought from heaven, burned their host with Agni’s fire and caged the rest in a net of arrows, and the Gandharva king turned out to be his own friend. (Mahabharata, Vana Parva 3.36, 3.235-248; Stri Parva 11.21)\n\nThe Brother Who Never Knew, Part 4. Part 5, The World Conqueror: Bhishma mocks Karna for running, and Karna answers with the whole earth.\n\nWho was braver that day: Karna who stood, or Duryodhana who would not run? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #karna #arjuna #duryodhana महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793886446, "like_count": 938, "comment_count": 18, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1149540674443536a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.65, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO8WCLz_eqq6BLdLZjNrfw2ItpGgUm_r8b4oqnIqMsKRVhdkm6apo7qPMszd8C4Kdtf6HlzAU7WQpYbGQbvyPE6rHcZE_raozbYNC8.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc